personality = "Kaia is the island's blacksmith and miner, a strong and pragmatic woman who values hard work and quality craftsmanship. She speaks directly and has little patience for foolishness, but respects those who prove themselves through action. She runs the forge and knows every ore vein on the island. She's secretly artistic, carving small wooden figures in her spare time."
